<title>HONG KONG: DC Finance in deal talks, shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>DC Finance in deal talks, shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>DC Finance (Holdings) Ltd said it was in the final stages of negotiations concerning a major transaction and had requested a trading suspension in its shares, effective Friday, pending a further announcement.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is in the final stage of negotiation in relation to a transaction which...may constitute a major transaction,&quot; DC Finance said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;However, shareholders are reminded that the transaction may or may not materialise,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>DC Finance shares closed at HK$1.69 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
